{"answers":[{"question":"Can you walk me through a time when you audited or optimized a CRM or ticketing system to improve frontline performance?","bullets":["I audited frontline workflows by reviewing queue performance, SLA misses, and recurring friction points, then mapped those patterns to changes in our support tooling and process.","At Benchmark, I led automation and systems integration across Freshdesk, Zendesk, and RingCentral, which reduced resolution time by 38%, improved first response time by 45%, and lowered average handle time by 32%.","I reinforced the operational gains by implementing a Power BI Support Operations Hub with Python integrations and real-time queue monitoring so leaders and agents could act on issues quickly and consistently."]}],"suggestions":[{"question":"Can you walk me through a time when you audited or optimized a CRM or ticketing system to improve frontline performance?","referenced_transcript":"System Audio: Can you walk me through a time When you audited or optimized a CRM or ticketing consistent to improve frontline","bullets":["I’d focus on the measurable before-and-after impact, like faster first response and resolution times, tied directly to workflow and integration changes.","I’d mention the specific systems I optimized, such as Freshdesk and Zendesk, to show hands-on platform ownership.","I’d close by describing how I operationalized visibility with real-time monitoring so improvements stuck and frontline teams could self-correct quickly."]}],"notes":[],"memory_cards":[]}
